# Catalog facade boundary (grocery)

## Must

- Outside `com.pos.catalog`, new code loads products only via `com.pos.catalog.api.CatalogFacade` → `ProductRef`.
- Full card / admin CRUD stays on `ProductService` + `ProductResponse` (HTTP `/products`).
- Stock qty ownership stays with Inventory (`StoreStockService` / `store_stock`); see `stock-ownership.mdc`.

## Must NOT

- Add new imports of `com.pos.catalog.repository.ProductRepository` outside `com.pos.catalog`.
- Add new service-layer use of JPA `com.pos.catalog.entity.Product` outside `com.pos.catalog` (legacy callers migrate in waves B–D).
- Wire production traffic to `catalog-service` until Wave 4–5 cutover is verified.
- Flip `app.catalog.enabled=true` only for dual-read experiments / cutover — default remains local Catalog SoT.
- When enabled, `CatalogRemoteReadBridge` follows `app.catalog.read-mode` (`REMOTE_FIRST` / `REMOTE_ONLY`); weight/PLU stays local.
- When enabled, `CatalogDualWritePublisher` upserts after commit via `ProductSnapshotNotifier` (best-effort; local SoT still wins on failure).
- Bulk seed: categories first `POST .../backfill-categories`, then `POST .../backfill` (ADMIN; `enabled=true`).
- Category UUID = `CatalogLegacyIds.categoryId(companyId, intId)` (shared-kernel).
- Verify: `GET /products/catalog-service/verify` compares local vs remote counts (+ sample id checks).
- Put live stock qty into `catalog_db` — Inventory owns `store_stock`.

## Allowed temporary debt

- Sales/Inventory hold `product_id` UUID + snapshots **without** DB FK to `products` (Wave 2.5). Catalog tables still FK internally.
- `CatalogManagedProductLoader` / `SaleItemProductLoader` for ops that still need managed Product (stock mutate, events).
- `StoreStockService` may use `ProductRepository` only to refresh denorm `products.stock_quantity`.
- `catalog-service` ready through Wave 5.4 (dual-read/write, category sync, deactivate). Default `enabled=false` — local SoT. Cutover paused; see `catalog-cutover.mdc`.
- Do not delete web-backend `products` until write-cutover.

## Enforcement

- ArchUnit: `CatalogBoundaryArchTest` — no `ProductRepository` outside `com.pos.catalog..` except `StoreStockService`.
